          "title": "Behavioral Analysis Scenario",
          "type": "scenario",
          "scenario": "You are monitoring a social media account that has shown consistent posting patterns for six months. Suddenly, the account's posting frequency increases by 300%, the content becomes more emotional and urgent, and the account begins engaging with previously unconnected networks. The posting times also shift to a different timezone.",
